{
  "id": "E161",
  "title": "Overseas Purchases",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2017-10-13",
  "synopsis": "Have you ever asked someone to buy things for you abroad?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/550/d04be071a8bb221b7e34caf03fe766cbc1ca53b4.mp3?1507447374",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "做代购\n\n小丽：保罗，听说你下个星期要去上海，打算呆几天？\n保罗：我去出差，就呆一周。\n小丽：如果你有时间，能顺便帮我个忙吗？\n保罗：你是不是想让我做“代购”，帮你买东西？\n小丽：我就知道你最聪明了。\n保罗：别拍马屁，你想买什么？\n小丽：小笼包、生煎包、大闸蟹、小龙虾，还有……\n保罗：停停停，难道你想让我把全上海的小吃都买回来吗？\n小丽：没办法，我不在中国，不能上淘宝买这些东西啊。",
    "traditional": "做代購\n\n小麗：保羅，聽說你下個星期要去上海，打算呆幾天？\n保羅：我去出差，就呆一週。\n小麗：如果你有時間，能順便幫我個忙嗎？\n保羅：你是不是想讓我做“代購”，幫你買東西？\n小麗：我就知道你最聰明了。\n保羅：別拍馬屁，你想買什麼？\n小麗：小籠包、生煎包、大閘蟹、小龍蝦，還有……\n保羅：停停停，難道你想讓我把全上海的小吃都買回來嗎？\n小麗：沒辦法，我不在中國，不能上淘寶買這些東西啊。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Overseas Purchases"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小丽：保罗，听说你下个星期要去上海，打算呆几天？",
      "traditional": "小麗：保羅，聽說你下個星期要去上海，打算呆幾天？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lì bǎo luó tīng shuō nǐ xià ge xīng qī yào qù shàng hǎi dǎ suàn dāi jǐ tiān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Xiao Li: Paul, I heard you are going to Shanghai next week, how long do you plan to stay there?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：我去出差，就呆一周。",
      "traditional": "保羅：我去出差，就呆一週。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ qù chū chāi jiù dāi yì zhōu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: It’s a business trip. I will only be there for one week."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小丽：如果你有时间，能顺便帮我个忙吗？",
      "traditional": "小麗：如果你有時間，能順便幫我個忙嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lì rú guǒ nǐ yǒu shí jiān néng shùn biàn bāng wǒ ge máng ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Xiao Li: If you have the time, could you do me a favor?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：你是不是想让我做“代购”，帮你买东西？",
      "traditional": "保羅：你是不是想讓我做“代購”，幫你買東西？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nǐ shì bú shì xiǎng ràng wǒ zuò dài gòu bāng nǐ mǎi dōng xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: You want me to make a purchase, buy items for you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小丽：我就知道你最聪明了。",
      "traditional": "小麗：我就知道你最聰明了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lì wǒ jiù zhī dào nǐ zuì cōng ming le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Xiao Li: I always knew you were really clever!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "保罗：别拍马屁，你想买什么？",
      "traditional": "保羅：別拍馬屁，你想買什麼？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó bié pāi mǎ pì nǐ xiǎng mǎi shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: No need for flattery, what do you want me to buy?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小丽：小笼包、生煎包、大闸蟹、小龙虾，还有……",
      "traditional": "小麗：小籠包、生煎包、大閘蟹、小龍蝦，還有……",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lì xiǎo lóng bāo shēng jiān bāo dà zhá xiè xiǎo lóng xiā hái yǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Xiao Li: Juicy steamed buns, Pan-Fried buns, Chinese mitten crabs, crayfish, and…"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "保罗：停停停，难道你想让我把全上海的小吃都买回来吗？",
      "traditional": "保羅：停停停，難道你想讓我把全上海的小吃都買回來嗎？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó tíng tíng tíng nán dào nǐ xiǎng ràng wǒ bǎ quán shàng hǎi de xiǎo chī dōu mǎi huí lái ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Stop, stop, stop! Are you going to have me buy all the food in Shanghai for you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "小丽：没办法，我不在中国，不能上淘宝买这些东西啊。",
      "traditional": "小麗：沒辦法，我不在中國，不能上淘寶買這些東西啊。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lì méi bàn fǎ wǒ bú zài zhōng guó bù néng shàng táo bǎo mǎi zhè xiē dōng xi a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Xiao Li: It’s all because I’m not in China. I can’t buy everything from Taobao anymore."
    }
